ground, we didn't do, you know, we changed

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.490
hardly anything as well.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.490
Yes.

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:38.150
And you have now, you know, the opposition
was calling for more restrictions, further

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.510
